'''''Lampranthus emarginatus''''', commonly known as the '''cluster-leaf brightfig''', is a succulent plant belonging to the genus ''[[Lampranthus]]''.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Lampranthus emarginatus (L.) N.E.Br.|url=http://redlist.sanbi.org/species.php?species=88-69|work=SANBI Redlist}}</ref> The species is endemic to the [[Western Cape]] and forms part of the [[fynbos]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Lampranthus emarginatus (L.) N.E.Br.|url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:362210-1|work=Plants of the World Online}}</ref>

